/*
 * Declares an Occurrence, a token of the source declaring an entity or
 * referring to one: a symbol, or the declaration of a local variable, a
 * parameter or a field. A token spans its line, from its column to its
 * column plus its length.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::index::occurrence
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/index/occurrence.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
